{
    "type": "page",
    "title": "住房公积金缴存断缴风险",
    "initApi": {
        "method": "get",
        "url": "/api/demo/header-info"
    },
    "subTitle": "${displayText}",
    "titleClassName": "text-center",
    "bodyClassName": "p-3",
    "style": {
        "backgroundColor": "#f7f8fa"
    },
    "css": {
        ".cxd-Page-headerRow": {
            "position": "relative !important",
            "display": "flex !important",
            "justify-content": "center !important",
            "align-items": "flex-start !important",
            "padding": "0 !important",
            "margin-bottom": "0 !important"
        },
        ".cxd-Page-header": {
            "width": "100% !important",
            "flex": "1 1 auto !important",
            "text-align": "center !important",
            "padding": "0 !important",
            "margin": "0 !important",
            "border": "none !important"
        },
        ".cxd-Page-toolbar": {
            "position": "absolute !important",
            "right": "0px !important",
            "top": "10px !important",
            "height": "auto !important",
            "min-height": "0 !important",
            "width": "auto !important",
            "margin": "0 !important",
            "z-index": "100"
        },
        ".cxd-Page-title": {
            "text-align": "center !important",
            "display": "block",
            "font-size": "24px",
            "font-weight": "600",
            "color": "#1d1d1f",
            "margin-top": "10px",
            "margin-bottom": "5px"
        },
        ".cxd-Page-subTitle": {
            "text-align": "center !important",
            "display": "block",
            "color": "#666",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "font-size": "13px",
            "margin-bottom": "20px"
        }
    },
    "toolbar": [
        {
            "type": "button",
            "label": "生成风险分析报告",
            "level": "danger",
            "actionType": "dialog",
            "dialog": {
                "title": "生成风险分析报告",
                "size": "lg",
                "body": {
                    "type": "form",
                    "api": "post:/api/report/generate",
                    "body": [
                        {
                            "type": "select",
                            "name": "report_type",
                            "label": "报告类型",
                            "options": [
                                {
                                    "label": "月度分析报告",
                                    "value": "month"
                                },
                                {
                                    "label": "季度分析报告",
                                    "value": "quarter"
                                }
                            ],
                            "required": true
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "input-date-range",
                            "name": "date_range",
                            "label": "时间范围",
                            "required": true
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "textarea",
                            "name": "remark",
                            "label": "备注说明"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            }
        }
    ],
    "body": [
        {
            "type": "tpl",
            "tpl": "<div style='margin-bottom: 12px;'><div style='background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px 24px; line-height: 1.7;'><div style='color: #1d1d1f; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding-left: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #1890ff;'>定义与分类</div><div style='margin-bottom: 20px;'><div style='color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;'>风险定义</div><div style='color: #333; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify;'>缴存异常风险是指公积金缴存单位因缴款不符合法定规范，或未正常缴纳、缴款异常中断等导致的公积金合规性风险。</div></div><div style='margin-bottom: 0;'><div style='color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;'>风险分类</div><div style='padding-left: 0; margin-top: 10px;'><div style='color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;'>1. 开户风险单位：单位/个人违法开户（伪造账户开户、使用多余名义开户、以违法事由开户），无实则真正注册证照，或违反规缴规定。</div><div style='color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;'>2. 缴存赋异常风险：缴存基数/比例与申报工资不匹配入额不符（意愿/虚报），频繁调整存档入额数据。</div><div style='color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;'>3. 人员赋配风险：单位违规批准入数，需承赋承，信用性已过信报性法与正常公积金投资。</div><div style='color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;'>4. 补缴赋配风险：违规未通用补缴违规法定规范虚报，无正常性入信为，以错误针对初次。</div><div style='color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;'>5. 应缴赋异缴批：公积金蓝莓赔验板局，缴存照赋通过批量直接板局，民过统规范应方法性，驾过规范赔验应趴。</div></div></div></div></div>"
        },
        {
            "type": "service",
            "id": "risk_analysis_root",
            "className": "p-none",
            "data": {
                "show_analysis_result": false
            },
            "body": [
                {
                    "type": "container",
                    "className": "m-t-lg",
                    "style": {
                        "border": "1px dashed #1890ff",
                        "borderRadius": "8px",
                        "backgroundColor": "#f0f7ff",
                        "padding": "30px",
                        "textAlign": "center"
                    },
                    "body": [
                        {
                            "type": "button-group",
                            "buttons": [
                                {
                                    "type": "button",
                                    "label": "☁️ 数据导入",
                                    "className": "m-r-lg",
                                    "style": {
                                        "border": "1px solid #1890ff",
                                        "color": "#003a8c",
                                        "backgroundColor": "#e6f7ff",
                                        "fontWeight": "bold",
                                        "width": "140px",
                                        "height": "40px"
                                    },
                                    "actionType": "dialog",
                                    "dialog": {
                                        "title": "2025年度风险数据归集",
                                        "size": "lg",
                                        "body": {
                                            "type": "form",
                                            "api": "post:/api/risk/import/batch",
                                            "mode": "normal",
                                            "body": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "container",
                                                    "className": "import-card-row",
                                                    "style": {
                                                        "border": "1px solid #e8e8e8",
                                                        "borderRadius": "6px",
                                                        "padding": "16px 20px",
                                                        "marginBottom": "12px",
                                                        "backgroundColor": "#fff",
                                                        "display": "flex",
                                                        "alignItems": "center",
                                                        "justifyContent": "space-between"
                                                    },
                                                    "body": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "tpl",
                                                            "tpl": "<div><div style='font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 4px;'>公积金提取明细表</div><div style='font-size: 12px; color: #999;'>请上传财务系统导出的原始 .xlsx</div></div>",
                                                            "style": {
                                                                "flex": "1"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "container",
                                                            "style": {
                                                                "display": "flex",
                                                                "alignItems": "center",
                                                                "gap": "10px"
                                                            },
                                                            "body": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "button",
                                                                    "label": "⬇ 下载模板",
                                                                    "level": "default",
                                                                    "size": "sm",
                                                                    "actionType": "download",
                                                                    "api": "/downloads/template_A.xlsx",
                                                                    "style": {
                                                                        "borderColor": "#d9d9d9",
                                                                        "color": "#666"
                                                                    }
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "input-file",
                                                                    "name": "file_gjj_detail",
                                                                    "btnLabel": "⬆ 上传文件",
                                                                    "level": "primary",
                                                                    "mode": "inline",
                                                                    "accept": ".xlsx,.xls",
                                                                    "maxSize": 10485760,
                                                                    "asBlob": true,
                                                                    "inputClassName": "m-b-none",
                                                                    "style": {
                                                                        "margin": "0"
                                                                    }
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "container",
                                                    "className": "import-card-row",
                                                    "style": {
                                                        "border": "1px solid #e8e8e8",
                                                        "borderRadius": "6px",
                                                        "padding": "16px 20px",
                                                        "marginBottom": "12px",
                                                        "backgroundColor": "#fff",
                                                        "display": "flex",
                                                        "alignItems": "center",
                                                        "justifyContent": "space-between"
                                                    },
                                                    "body": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "tpl",
                                                            "tpl": "<div><div style='font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 4px;'>不动产登记信息</div><div style='font-size: 12px; color: #999;'>包含抵押、查封状态</div></div>",
                                                            "style": {
                                                                "flex": "1"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "container",
                                                            "style": {
                                                                "display": "flex",
                                                                "alignItems": "center",
                                                                "gap": "10px"
                                                            },
                                                            "body": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "button",
                                                                    "label": "⬇ 下载模板",
                                                                    "level": "default",
                                                                    "size": "sm",
                                                                    "actionType": "download",
                                                                    "api": "/downloads/template_B.xlsx",
                                                                    "style": {
                                                                        "borderColor": "#d9d9d9",
                                                                        "color": "#666"
                                                                    }
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "input-file",
                                                                    "name": "file_house_status",
                                                                    "btnLabel": "⬆ 上传文件",
                                                                    "level": "primary",
                                                                    "mode": "inline",
                                                                    "accept": ".xlsx,.xls",
                                                                    "maxSize": 10485760,
                                                                    "asBlob": true,
                                                                    "inputClassName": "m-b-none",
                                                                    "style": {
                                                                        "margin": "0"
                                                                    }
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        "actions": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "button",
                                                "actionType": "cancel",
                                                "label": "取消"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "button",
                                                "actionType": "confirm",
                                                "label": "确定导入",
                                                "level": "primary"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "button",
                                    "label": "📊 智能分析",
                                    "level": "danger",
                                    "style": {
                                        "background": "linear-gradient(180deg, #ff4d4f 0%, #cf1322 100%)",
                                        "border": "none",
                                        "boxShadow": "0 4px 10px rgba(207, 19, 34, 0.3)",
                                        "fontWeight": "bold",
                                        "width": "140px",
                                        "height": "40px"
                                    },
                                    "onEvent": {
                                        "click": {
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "actionType": "setValue",
                                                    "componentId": "risk_analysis_root",
                                                    "args": {
                                                        "value": {
                                                            "show_analysis_result": true
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "actionType": "toast",
                                                    "args": {
                                                        "msgType": "info",
                                                        "msg": "正在请求 AI 生成分析报告，请稍候...",
                                                        "position": "top-center"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "service",
                    "id": "service_ai_result_area",
                    "className": "m-t-md",
                    "visibleOn": "${show_analysis_result}",
                    "initFetch": true,
                    "schemaApi": {
                        "method": "post",
                        "url": "/api/ai/generate",
                        "data": {
                            "pageId": "jcycdj",
                            "query": "请严格按照 amis 对 json 的要求返回数据",
                            "timestamp": "${new Date().getTime()}"
                        }
                    },
                    "spinner": {
                        "size": "lg",
                        "tip": "AI 正在思考并构建分析报表..."
                    },
                    "body": {
                        "type": "tpl",
                        "tpl": "",
                        "visible": false
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "tpl",
            "tpl": "<div style='text-align: center; color: #999; font-size: 12px; padding: 20px 0;'>XXX 公积金管理中心 © 2024</div>"
        }
    ]
}